Beyond electric vehicles, Tesla has been making significant strides in the renewable energy sector. The company’s Solar Roof and Powerwall products have gained traction, with over 150,000 installations reported in 2024. Tesla Energy now contributes around 15% of the company’s total revenue, signaling a growing shift toward energy sustainability.  

